{"suttaId":"sn43.44","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"S-iv","vriCode":"s0304m.mul","paras":[1918,1927],"vripara":"409"},"segments":{"sn43.44:0.3":"Parāyanasuttaṃ","sn43.44:1.1":"“Parāyanañca [parāyaṇañca (pī. sī. aṭṭha.)] vo, bhikkhave, desessāmi parāyanagāmiñca maggaṃ.","sn43.44:1.2":"Taṃ suṇātha.","sn43.44:1.3":"Katamañca, bhikkhave, parāyanaṃ?","sn43.44:1.4":"Yo, bhikkhave, rāgakkhayo dosakkhayo mohakkhayo – idaṃ vuccati, bhikkhave, parāyanaṃ.","sn43.44:1.6":"Katamo ca, bhikkhave, parāyanagāmī maggo?","sn43.44:1.7":"Kāyagatāsati.","sn43.44:1.8":"Ayaṃ vuccati, bhikkhave, parāyanagāmimaggo.","sn43.44:1.9":"Iti kho, bhikkhave, desitaṃ vo mayā parāyanaṃ, desito parāyanagāmimaggo.","sn43.44:1.10":"Yaṃ, bhikkhave, satthārā karaṇīyaṃ sāvakānaṃ hitesinā anukampakena anukampaṃ upādāya, kataṃ vo taṃ mayā.","sn43.44:1.11":"Etāni, bhikkhave, rukkhamūlāni, etāni suññāgārāni. Jhāyatha, bhikkhave, mā pamādattha; mā pacchā vippaṭisārino ahuvattha. Ayaṃ vo amhākaṃ anusāsanī”ti.(Yathā asaṅkhataṃ tathā vitthāretabbaṃ).","sn43.44:1.13":"Tettiṃsatimaṃ.","sn43.44:1.14":"Dutiyo vaggo.","sn43.44:2.0":"Tassuddānaṃ –","sn43.44:2.1":"Asaṅkhataṃ anataṃ anāsavaṃ, saccañca pāraṃ nipuṇaṃ sududdasaṃ;","sn43.44:2.3":"Ajajjaraṃ dhuvaṃ apalokitaṃ, anidassanaṃ nippapañca santaṃ.","sn43.44:3.1":"Amataṃ paṇītañca sivañca khemaṃ, taṇhākkhayo acchariyañca abbhutaṃ;","sn43.44:3.3":"Anītikaṃ anītikadhammaṃ, nibbānametaṃ sugatena desitaṃ.","sn43.44:4.1":"Abyāpajjho virāgo ca, suddhi mutti anālayo;","sn43.44:4.3":"Dīpo leṇañca tāṇañca, saraṇañca parāyananti.","sn43.44:4.5":"Asaṅkhatasaṃyuttaṃ samattaṃ."},"attha":{"book":"Spk-iv","bookName":"Saḷāyatanavagga-aṭṭhakathā","vriCode":"s0304a.att","from":777,"to":783,"paras":[{"para":777,"vripara":"377-409","refs":["sn43.44:1"],"lines":["377-409. <b>Kāye kāyānupassī</b>tiādīsu yaṃ vattabbaṃ, taṃ parato vakkhāma."],"lineRefs":[["sn43.44:1"]]},{"para":778,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["<b>Anatan</b>tiādīsu taṇhānatiyā abhāvena anataṃ.","Catunnaṃ āsavānaṃ abhāvena <b>anāsavaṃ</b>.","Paramatthasaccatāya <b>saccaṃ</b>.","Vaṭṭassa parabhāgaṭṭhena <b>pāraṃ</b>.","Saṇhaṭṭhena <b>nipuṇaṃ</b>.","Suṭṭhu duddasatāya <b>sududdasaṃ</b>.","Jarāya ajaritattā <b>ajajjaraṃ</b>.","Thiraṭṭhena <b>dhuvaṃ</b>.","Apalujjanatāya <b>apalokitaṃ</b>.","Cakkhuviññāṇena apassitabbattā <b>anidassanaṃ</b>.","Taṇhāmānadiṭṭhipapañcānaṃ abhāvena <b>nippapañcaṃ</b>."],"lineRefs":[[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[]]},{"para":779,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Santabhāvaṭṭhena <b>santaṃ</b>.","Maraṇābhāvena <b>amataṃ</b>.","Uttamaṭṭhena <b>paṇītaṃ</b>.","Sassirikaṭṭhena <b>sivaṃ</b>.","Nirupaddavatāya <b>khemaṃ</b>.","Taṇhākkhayassa paccayattā <b>taṇhakkhayaṃ</b>."],"lineRefs":[[],[],[],[],[],[]]},{"para":780,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Vimhāpanīyaṭṭhena accharaṃ paharitabbayuttakanti <b>acchariyaṃ</b>.","Abhūtameva bhūtaṃ ajātaṃ hutvā atthīti vā <b>abbhutaṃ</b>.","Niddukkhattā <b>anītikaṃ</b>.","Niddukkhasabhāvattā <b>anītikadhammaṃ</b>.","Vānābhāvena <b>nibbānaṃ</b>.","Byābajjhābhāveneva <b>abyābajjhaṃ</b>.","Virāgādhigamassa paccayato <b>virāgaṃ</b>.","Paramatthasuddhitāya <b>suddhi</b>.","Tīhi bhavehi muttatāya <b>mutti</b>.","Kāmālayānaṃ abhāvena <b>anālayaṃ</b>.","Patiṭṭhaṭṭhena <b>dīpaṃ</b>.","Allīyitabbayuttaṭṭhena <b>leṇaṃ</b>.","Tāyanaṭṭhena <b>tāṇaṃ</b>.","Bhayasaraṇaṭṭhena <b>saraṇaṃ,</b> bhayanāsananti attho.","Paraṃ ayanaṃ gati patiṭṭhāti <b>parāyaṇaṃ</b>.","Sesamettha vuttanayamevāti."],"lineRefs":[[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[]]},{"para":781,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Asaṅkhatasaṃyuttavaṇṇanā niṭṭhitā."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":782,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Abyākatasaṃyuttaṃ"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":783,"vripara":null,"refs":["sn43.44:1"],"lines":["Khemāsuttavaṇṇanā"],"lineRefs":[["sn43.44:1"]]}],"wordLinks":[]},"tika":{"book":"Spk-t-iv","bookName":"Saḷāyatanavagga-ṭīkā","vriCode":"s0304t.tik","from":702,"to":708,"paras":[{"para":702,"vripara":"377-409","refs":["sn43.44:1"],"lines":["377-409. Tattha ca natthi ettha taṇhāsaṅkhātaṃ nataṃ, natthi etasmiṃ vā adhigate puggalabhāvoti <b>anataṃ.</b>","<b>Anāsavan</b>ti etthāpi eseva nayo.","Saccadhammatāya <b>saccaṃ</b>.","Vaṭṭadukkhato pārametīti <b>pāraṃ.</b>","<b>Saṇhaṭṭhenā</b>ti sukhumaṭṭhena nipuṇaṃ.","Tato eva <b>duddasatāya.</b>","<b>Ajajjaraṃ</b> niccasabhāvattā.","Natthi etassa nidassananti vā <b>anidassanaṃ</b>.","Etasmiṃ adhigate natthi saṃsāre.","Papañcanti vā <b>nippapañcaṃ</b>."],"lineRefs":[["sn43.44:1"],["sn43.44:1"],["sn43.44:1"],["sn43.44:1"],["sn43.44:1"],["sn43.44:1"],["sn43.44:1"],["sn43.44:1"],["sn43.44:1"],["sn43.44:1"]]},{"para":703,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Etasmiṃ adhigate puggalassa maraṇaṃ natthīti vā <b>amataṃ</b>.","Atappakaṭṭhena vā <b>paṇītaṃ</b>.","Sukhahetutāya vā <b>sivaṃ</b>.","Taṇhā khīyanti etthāti <b>taṇhakkhayaṃ</b>."],"lineRefs":[[],[],[],[]]},{"para":704,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Aññassa tādisassa abhāvato vimhāpanīyatāya <b>abhūtamevā</b>ti.","Kutoci paccayato anibbattameva hutvā <b>bhūtaṃ</b> vijjamānaṃ.","Tenāha <b>“ajātaṃ hutvā atthī”</b>ti.","Natthi ettha dukkhanti niddukkhaṃ, tassa bhāvo <b>niddukkhattaṃ</b>.","Tasmā <b>anītikaṃ</b> ītirahitaṃ.","Vānaṃ vuccati taṇhā, tadabhāvena <b>nibbānaṃ</b>.","Byābajjhaṃ vuccati dukkhaṃ, tadabhāvena <b>abyābajjhaṃ</b>.","Paramatthato saccato suddhibhāvena.","Kāmā eva puthujjanehi allīyitabbato <b>ālayā</b>.","Esa nayo sesesupi.","<b>Patiṭṭhaṭṭhenā</b>ti patiṭṭhābhāvena vaṭṭadukkhato muccitukāmānaṃ dīpasadisaṃ oghehi anajjhottharaṇīyattā.","<b>Allīyitabbayuttaṭṭhenā</b>ti allīyituṃ arahabhāvato.","<b>Tāyanaṭṭhenā</b>ti saparatāyanaṭṭhena.","<b>Bhayasaraṇaṭṭhenā</b>ti bhayassa hiṃsanaṭṭhena.","<b>Seṭṭhaṃ</b> uttamaṃ.","<b>Gatī</b>ti gandhabbaṭṭhānaṃ."],"lineRefs":[[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[]]},{"para":705,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Asaṅkhatasuttādivaṇṇanā niṭṭhitā."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":706,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Asaṅkhatasaṃyuttavaṇṇanā niṭṭhitā."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":707,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Abyākatasaṃyuttaṃ"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":708,"vripara":null,"refs":["sn43.44:1"],"lines":["Khemāsuttavaṇṇanā"],"lineRefs":[["sn43.44:1"]]}],"wordLinks":[]}}
